Privacy Policy – SEO Agent
Last updated: September 30, 2026

SEO Agent is an internal tool operated by UOYmedia. It publishes blog articles from our own Shopify store to our own social media accounts (such as Pinterest and Facebook Pages).

Data we access
When you connect a social account, we access basic profile information (username, account ID, profile picture), the list of boards or pages you choose, and permission to create pins or posts on your behalf.

How we use it
Only to publish content that a user of the tool explicitly chooses to share. We do not sell or share this data with third parties, and we do not use it for advertising.

Storage and security
Access tokens are stored on our server and are used only to publish the selected content. They are deleted when the account is disconnected in the tool.

Your choices and deletion
You can disconnect an account at any time in the tool, or revoke access from your Pinterest or Facebook account settings. To request deletion of any stored data, contact us at CONTACT_EMAIL.
